<title>USA: Philadelphia Fed business index 1.6 in May.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia Fed business index 1.6 in May.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia on Thursday said its index of business activity in the manufacturing sector fell to 1.6 in May from 5.7 in April.</p>
<p>				May   Drop   Unch   Rise   April</p>
<p>Business Conditions     1.6   19.1   58.5   20.7     5.7</p>
<p>New orders		  8.6   22.6   44.8   31.2    10.5</p>
<p>Shipments		  12.1   20.2   46.3   32.3    19.0</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	 - 7.1   25.2   56.2   18.1   - 5.3</p>
<p>Delivery time	   -11.5   20.4   70.7    8.9   - 9.0</p>
<p>Inventories	     -13.1   32.9   45.1   19.7   - 5.2</p>
<p>Prices paid		16.2    5.5   72.8   21.7    19.9</p>
<p>Prices received	 - 0.7    8.7   83.4    7.9   - 1.8</p>
<p>Number of employees     8.7   11.7   67.9   20.4     4.1</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660 ))</p>
